  "body": "Fixes #1274 \r\n\r\nThis branch re-applies @lilitkarapetyan 's changes to the relevant legacy branch.\r\n\r\nThere is a remaining issue.  When a duplicate of a message is created, the existing message is removed from the browser.\r\n\r\nA F5 refresh shows the existing message is still in the database, but:\r\n* the initial message has its `Reference` changed to the new message\r\n* as the new message is handled in `handleNonInfoMessage` the code mistakenly thinks there is a previous instance of the message, and it is deleted.",
  "created_at": "2021-12-20T13:43:47Z",
  "updated_at": "2022-04-07T08:10:09Z",
  "closed_at": "2021-12-20T13:46:50Z",
